#: code:addons/purchase_requisition/models/purchase_requisition.py:0
msgid "You can only delete draft or cancelled requisitions."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດລຶບໄດ້ສະເພາະໃບສະເໜີຈັດຊື້ທີ່ເປັນສະບັບຮ່າງ ຫຼື ຖືກຍົກເລີກແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: purchase_requisition
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/purchase_requisition/models/purchase_requisition.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot change the Agreement Type or Company of a not draft purchase "
"agreement."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນປະເພດຂໍ້ຕົກລົງ ຫຼື ບໍລິສັດ ຂອງຂໍ້ຕົກລົງການຈັດຊື້ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນສະບັບຮ່າງໄດ້."

#. module: purchase_requisition
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/purchase_requisition/models/purchase_requisition.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot change the type of a purchase agreement line. Instead you should "
"delete the current line and create a new line of the proper type."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນປະເພດແຖວຂໍ້ຕົກລົງການຈັດຊື້ໄດ້. ແຕ່ທ່ານຄວນລຶບແຖວປະຈຸບັນອອກ ແລ້ວສ້າງແຖວໃໝ່ຕາມປະເພດທີ່"
"ຖືກຕ້ອງແທນ."

#. module: purchase_requisition
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/purchase_requisition/models/purchase_requisition.py:0
msgid "You cannot confirm a blanket order with lines missing a price."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຢືນຢັນໃບສັ່ງຊື້ແບບກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາ ທີ່ມີລາຍການຂາດລາຄາໄດ້."

#. module: purchase_requisition
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/purchase_requisition/models/purchase_requisition.py:0
msgid "You cannot confirm a blanket order with lines missing a quantity."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຢືນຢັນໃບສັ່ງຊື້ແບບກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາ ທີ່ມີລາຍການຂາດຈຳນວນໄດ້."

#. module: purchase_requisition
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/purchase_requisition/models/purchase_requisition.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot have a negative or unit price of 0 for an already confirmed "
"blanket order."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດໃສ່ລາຄາຕິດລົບ ຫຼື ລາຄາຕໍ່ຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນ 0 ສຳລັບໃບສັ່ງຊື້ແບບກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຖືກຢືນຢັນແລ້ວໄດ້."

